OL,3,AMusic group fulfills late MP's Broadway
OL,4,Adream
OL,5,
OL,6,FA music group with learning
OL,7,Fdisabilities received a standing
OL,8,Fovation as they fulfilled a dream of
OL,9,Fthe late MP Sir David Amess.
OL,11,FThe Music Man Project is a charity
OL,12,Fbased in Southend-on-Sea, Essex, that
OL,13,Fteaches children and adults with
OL,14,Flearning disabilities to sing, sign and
OL,15,Fplay original music.
OL,17,FThey have performed for the King, at
OL,18,Fthe Royal Albert Hall and London
OL,19,FPalladium, but a trip to perform in New
OL,20,FYork was the dream of their former
OL,21,Fpresident and Southend West MP Amess
OL,22,Fbefore he was murdered in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
